#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
floci-cli is the official command-line interface for Floci (https://floci.io),
a free, open-source local cloud emulator for AWS, GCP, Azure, and OCI. It
manages the Floci Docker container's lifecycle (start/stop/status/logs) and
exports SDK/CLI environment variables so tools like the AWS CLI, gcloud, az,
and oci can talk to the local emulator instead of a real cloud account.

This plugin installs the native `floci` binary published on floci-cli's
GitHub Releases (https://github.com/floci-io/floci-cli/releases). Docker is
required at runtime to actually start Floci; this plugin only manages the
CLI binary itself.
EOF
